{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Dressing the Part", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Tie That Matches", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about something that will be complete by a certain time in the future. This is the past in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span>, you often refer to a time period. <br> For example: <br><span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"underline\">By this time next week</span>, you <span class=\"strong\">will have proven</span> to everyone that you are the best person for the job!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You often use the preposition <span class=\"italic\">by</span> with the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span>. <span class=\"italic\">By</span> means <span class=\"italic\">no later than</span> or can suggest the idea of progress up to a particular time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for the form of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect<span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + have + past participle\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have chosen</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a tie.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "By this time next week, you will have proven to everyone that you are the best person for the job!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "By next week, I will have chosen a tie, at least.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will have made a decision by then.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They will have hired me by the time I decide on a tie. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Modals for Request: Could and Would ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to make polite requests you use indirect styles of speaking.  <br>The <span class=\"strong\">modal verbs</span> <span class=\"italic\">would</span> and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> make requests more indirect.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Indirect speech is longer and wordier than direct speech ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could</span> you tell me where the men's attire is, please? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Would</span> you be able to help me choose a tie? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Would</span> you please show me more red ties? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could </span> you help me tie this tie?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "For example: <br> Direct = <span class=\"italic\">Where is the tie store?</span><br>Indirect = <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Could</span> you tell me where the tie store is?</span>  <br>&nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp or<br>&nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp &nbsp <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">Would </span> you be able to tell me where the tie store is?</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fashion statement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "giving information about yourself from the clothes you choose to wear", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The color and design of your tie is more than just a fashion statement, it gives people insight into your attitude and personality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and clothing.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hello, could you tell me where the men's attire is, please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "attitude", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way a person thinks; the approach a person takes to situations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The color and design of your tie is more than just a fashion statement, it gives people insight into your attitude and personality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "selection", "type": "name"}, {"content": "choice", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have a large selection?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dignified", "type": "name"}, {"content": "professional-looking; elegant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It suggests you are classy, serious and dignified.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Visit a store and go to their business attire section.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take a look at what kind of clothes they have on offer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask the sales clerk what they think the best combinations of clothes are.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a brief summary of what you saw and learned.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your thoughts and opinions with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I visit a local department store and think about work attire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a summary about work attire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk to my partner about what I saw.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sales Clerk</span>: Hello, how can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Hello, could you tell me where the men's attire is, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>: Yes, of course. It's right over here. Are you buying an outfit for a special occasion?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I have a job interview next week. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Oh, congratulations. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Would you be able to help me choose a tie?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Nothing would make me happier. What color is your suit and shirt?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I will be wearing a black suit with a light blue shirt.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "36000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>: That's a nice combination. The color and design of your tie is more than just a fashion statement, it gives people insight into your attitude and personality. You'll want to choose one carefully. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Do you have a large selection?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  We have the largest selection of ties in the city. With a black suit, it's easy to choose a tie that matches. Have you chosen a color? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Not really.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Consider red. It is known as the \u201cpower tie\u201d. You will be viewed as determined, intelligent and powerful. You'll make an excellent first impression. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>:  I'm not sure if I am determined, intelligent and powerful.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Maybe blue would be a better choice. It says you are trustworthy, confident and mature. That's good at a job interview.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Can you tell me what you think about black?  <br>"}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "94000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Certainly. A black tie is also a good option. It suggests you are classy, serious and dignified.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Is there anything that says I am desperate and willing to do anything for this job?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sales clerk</span>:  Oh, come on!  You need to have more confidence in yourself! By this time next week, you will have proven to everyone that you are the best person for the job! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Well, by this time next week I will have chosen a tie, in any case.<br>"}], "coverimg": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can make and respond to a request. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can discuss future plans. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about events and experiences related to jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you think your choice of color says about your personality? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think that some people look better in certain colors? What about you? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Would you be able to help me choose a tie?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Adam goes shopping for work attire. What <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">advice</span> does the sales clerk give him?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": "Sales clerks are paid to give fashion <span class=\"italic\">\u201cadvice\u201d</span> in most clothing stores in North America.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"con